      "description": "Freight Ninja LLC is a Lombard, Illinois-based provider of industrial outdoor storage and managed parking for trucks, trailers, containers and commercial fleets. Established in 2022, the company provides site management, security, technology, access and operating support across a nationwide location network. LAZ Parking stated on May 6, 2025 that it had acquired a majority interest in Freight Ninja; the exact stake, retained seller or management ownership and legal closing date were not publicly disclosed. Freight Ninja's current site reports more than 65 facilities in 14 states, compared with 50 leased or managed locations, more than 300 acres and 10,000 spaces disclosed by LAZ at acquisition. Freight Ninja continues as a distinct active LLC, while Argo Infrastructure Partners' directly evidenced manager-level investment is LAZ. Freight Ninja is therefore archived from the standalone manager-level PortCo census as an acquisition beneath LAZ, with no legal merge, Argo exit or signed pending transaction identified through August 16, 2026.",
